==Description==
'''Easter Snapper Charm''' is an exclusive charm introduced in [[Spring Frenzy Battle Pass]] as a reward for reaching Level 13 on the premium track. It had a cost of {{Bunz|380}} or {{Robux|86}}. The total cost was {{Bunz|2,460}} or {{Robux|827}}.

==Appearance==
'''Easter Snapper Charm''' showcases the {{Color|SpringFrenzy|Garden}} [[Tesla]]'s snapper in a giant pot. It plays a sound of a plant being planted.

The color of the '''Easter Snapper Charm''' depends on the color of the player's name in chat, but it is purple in its preview in the inventory.

